      "description": "The meme perpetuates a harmful stereotype by falsely claiming East Asian people have 'English tattoos' and equating it to 'soup', reducing their identity to a superficial and inaccurate cultural reference. This is rooted in anti-Asian racism and the 'foreign infiltrator' trope.",
