      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target audience is individuals who are familiar with or find humor in culturally insensitive stereotypes, particularly those who may be aware of or perpetuate anti-Asian racism tropes such as the 'foreign infiltrator' and 'all look the same' claims. The meme is designed to appeal to an audience that finds crude, offensive analogies amusing, especially those who understand the pun on 'soup' and 'sou' as a joke, even if it is rooted in harmful stereotypes. The audience likely includes people who engage with internet memes that rely on visual and textual juxtaposition for humor, often without considering the offensive implications.",
